### VS Code ###
.vscode/

# JWT signing keys — dev-generated pair at project root is never committed.
# The pair under src/main/resources/keys/ IS committed so the jar bundles it
# (classpath:keys/…) and deploys to every environment. If the private key must
# NOT live in git, delete resources/keys, keep this app on `file:` with an
# absolute server path, and provide the key at deploy time instead.
/keys/
